ragraph_id":"c-shiji-040-chu:p042","quote":"六年，使太子建居城父，守邊。無忌又日夜讒太子建於王曰：「自無忌入秦女，太子怨，亦不能無望於王，王少自備焉。且太子居城父，擅兵，外交諸侯，且欲入矣。」平王召其傅伍奢責之。伍奢知無忌讒，乃曰：「王柰何以小臣疎骨肉？」無忌曰：「今不制，後悔也。」於是王遂囚伍奢〈而召其二子而告以免父死〉。乃令司馬奮揚召太子建，欲誅之。太子聞之，亡奔宋。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-040-chu:p043","quote":"無忌曰：「伍奢有二子，不殺者爲楚國患。盍以免其父召之，必至。」於是王使使謂奢：「能致二子則生，不能將死。」奢曰：「尚至，胥不至。」王曰：「何也？」奢曰：「尚之爲人，廉，死節，慈孝而仁，聞召而免父，必至，不顧其死。胥之爲人，智而好謀，勇而矜功，知來必死，必不來。然爲楚國憂者必此子。」於是王使人召之，曰：「來，吾免爾父。」伍尚謂伍胥曰：「聞父免而莫奔，不孝也；父戮莫報，無謀也；度能任事，知也。子其行矣，我其歸死。」伍尚遂歸。伍胥彎弓屬矢，出見使者，曰：「父有罪，何以召其子爲？」將射，使者還走，遂出奔呉。伍奢聞之，曰：「胥亡，楚國危哉。」楚人遂殺伍奢及尚。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-040-chu:p046","quote":"昭王元年，楚衆不説費無忌，以其讒亡太子建，殺伍奢子父與郤宛。宛之宗姓伯氏子及子胥皆奔呉，呉兵數侵楚，楚人怨無忌甚。楚令尹子常誅無忌以説衆，衆乃喜。"}],"rationale":"依本段具體職事、引語或親屬用稱暫接未名個人／短名，未補氏名；不同段同職名不得自動相接。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:p041","text":"平王二年，使費無忌如秦爲太子建取婦。婦好，來，未至，無忌先歸，説平王曰：「秦女好，可自娶，爲太子更求。」平王聽之，卒自娶秦女，生熊珍。更爲太子娶。是時伍奢爲太子太傅，無忌爲少傅。無忌無寵於太子，常讒惡太子建。建時年十五矣，其母蔡女也，無寵於王，王稍益疎外建也。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m041-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"平王","kind":"person","person_id":"0va_zus_2zt_AAE","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m041-0006","start":6,"end":9,"surface":"費無忌","kind":"person","person_id":"z4i_gl4_8un","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m041-0012","start":12,"end":15,"surface":"太子建","kind":"person","person_id":"gau_cq7_7g1","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m041-0026","start":26,"end":28,"surface":"無忌","kind":"person","person_id":"z4i_gl4_8un","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m041-0032","start":32,"end":34,"surface":"平王","kind":"person","person_id":"0va_zus_2zt_AAE","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m041-0037","start":37,"end":39,"surface":"秦女","kind":"person","person_id":"hil_pvv_3c6","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m041-0052","start":52,"end":54,"surface":"平王","kind":"person","person_id":"0va_zus_2zt_AAE","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m041-0060","start":60,"end":62,"surface":"秦女","kind":"person","person_id":"hil_pvv_3c6","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m041-0064","start":64,"end":66,"surface":"熊珍","kind":"person","person_id":"0va_zus_2zt_AAEA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m041-0075","start":75,"end":77,"surface":"伍奢","kind":"person","person_id":"zk0_g6b_nbq","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m041-0083","start":83,"end":85,"surface":"無忌","kind":"person","person_id":"z4i_gl4_8un","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m041-0089","start":89,"end":91,"surface":"無忌","kind":"person","person_id":"z4i_gl4_8un","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m041-0100","start":100,"end":103,"surface":"太子建","kind":"person","person_id":"gau_cq7_7g1","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m041-0104","start":104,"end":105,"surface":"建","kind":"person","person_id":"gau_cq7_7g1","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m041-0113","start":113,"end":115,"surface":"蔡女","kind":"person","person_id":"fbw_boe_fyu","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m041-0127","start":127,"end":128,"surface":"建","kind":"person","person_id":"gau_cq7_7g1","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-040-chu","book_id":"b-shiji-040","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-040-chu"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:p042","text":"六年，使太子建居城父，守邊。無忌又日夜讒太子建於王曰：「自無忌入秦女，太子怨，亦不能無望於王，王少自備焉。且太子居城父，擅兵，外交諸侯，且欲入矣。」平王召其傅伍奢責之。伍奢知無忌讒，乃曰：「王柰何以小臣疎骨肉？」無忌曰：「今不制，後悔也。」於是王遂囚伍奢〈而召其二子而告以免父死〉。乃令司馬奮揚召太子建，欲誅之。太子聞之，亡奔宋。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m042-0004","start":4,"end":7,"surface":"太子建","kind":"person","person_id":"gau_cq7_7g1","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m042-0014","start":