"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:p043","text":"無忌曰：「伍奢有二子，不殺者爲楚國患。盍以免其父召之，必至。」於是王使使謂奢：「能致二子則生，不能將死。」奢曰：「尚至，胥不至。」王曰：「何也？」奢曰：「尚之爲人，廉，死節，慈孝而仁，聞召而免父，必至，不顧其死。胥之爲人，智而好謀，勇而矜功，知來必死，必不來。然爲楚國憂者必此子。」於是王使人召之，曰：「來，吾免爾父。」伍尚謂伍胥曰：「聞父免而莫奔，不孝也；父戮莫報，無謀也；度能任事，知也。子其行矣，我其歸死。」伍尚遂歸。伍胥彎弓屬矢，出見使者，曰：「父有罪，何以召其子爲？」將射，使者還走，遂出奔呉。伍奢聞之，曰：「胥亡，楚國危哉。」楚人遂殺伍奢及尚。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m043-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"無忌","kind":"person","person_id":"z4i_gl4_8un","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m043-0005","start":5,"end":7,"surface":"伍奢","kind":"person","person_id":"zk0_g6b_nbq","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m043-0008","start":8,"end":10,"surface":"二子","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、寓言人物或未定指代，未補未見姓名、全體成員或親屬關係。"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m043-0037","start":37,"end":38,"surface":"奢","kind":"person","person_id":"zk0_g6b_nbq","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m043-0042","start":42,"end":44,"surface":"二子","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、寓言人物或未定指代，未補未見姓名、全體成員或親屬關係。"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m043-0053","start":53,"end":54,"surface":"奢","kind":"person","person_id":"zk0_g6b_nbq","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m043-0057","start":57,"end":58,"surface":"尚","kind":"person","person_id":"zk0_g6b_nbq_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m043-0060","start":60,"end":61,"surface":"胥","kind":"person","person_id":"zk0_g6b_nbq_B","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m043-0073","start":73,"end":74,"surface":"奢","kind":"person","person_id":"zk0_g6b_nbq","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m043-0077","start":77,"end":78,"surface":"尚","kind":"person","person_id":"zk0_g6b_nbq_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m043-0106","start":106,"end":107,"surface":"胥","kind":"person","